batch_prompt:
You are the quality reviewer of a short educational video. Below are {count} frames, one from each beat of the reel, each introduced by its beat number, the narration spoken during it and what it is meant to show.
{frames}
{layout_note}

Score EACH frame from 0 to 10 and list concrete, fixable problems. Check: (1) does the picture show what the narration is about, with the right objects, rather than abstract or decorative shapes; (2) is the main subject fully visible and not cropped; (3) does any text card, label or tag cover or collide with the main subject or other text; (4) is all text legible and spelled sensibly; (5) is the composition balanced, with the subject large enough to read; (6) does anything look physically or factually wrong for the narration. Be strict: 7 or more means a viewer would not notice a flaw. Reply with JSON only: {"beats": [{"beat": integer, "score": integer, "issues": ["short, specific, fixable problem"]}, ...]} with exactly one entry per frame.
